{"id":"c043","number":43,"title":"不是因为医院","label":"第四十三章 不是因为医院","volumeId":"v2","sourceHeadingParagraph":10811,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"办完出院手续之后，程野的父亲执意要自己拎随身的物件。","sourceParagraph":10812},{"type":"paragraph","text":"东西并不算繁多：一只磨得边角发乌的黑色旅行袋，一塑料袋分装妥当的药品，半只喝剩的水杯，还有程野昨日买来的充电器。","sourceParagraph":10813},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野伸出手，打算接过那只沉甸甸的旅行袋。父亲侧身轻轻避开，五指紧紧攥住提手，姿态执拗，仿佛下一秒袋子就会被人强行夺走。","sourceParagraph":10814},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我自己来。」","sourceParagraph":10815},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野伸在半空的手顿住。若是搁在前几日，他多半会直接伸手抢过来。但这一刻，他只是垂眸望向那道被绳索反复磨出浅痕的提手，目光静静停留片刻。","sourceParagraph":10816},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「拎着沉不沉。」","sourceParagraph":10817},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲把袋子往上掂了掂，肩膀下意识往下陷落少许，随即又硬撑着挺直脊背。","sourceParagraph":10818},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不沉。」","sourceParagraph":10819},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「当真不沉？」","sourceParagraph":10820},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「难不成你觉得，我出一趟院，就成了行动不便的人。」","sourceParagraph":10821},{"type":"paragraph","text":"站在一旁的母亲眉头骤然蹙起，眉宇间拧出一道浅浅的褶皱。","sourceParagraph":10822},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你少说这种不吉利的话。」","sourceParagraph":10823},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男人侧过头，唇角扯出一抹略带抵触的弧度。","sourceParagraph":10824},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我又没说错什么。」","sourceParagraph":10825},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「听得出来不妥，就不该讲出口。」","sourceParagraph":10826},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那又如何。」","sourceParagraph":10827},{"type":"paragraph","text":"才刚踏出病房门口，两个人之间便隐隐泛起争执的苗头。","sourceParagraph":10828},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走廊尽头的窗户透进一片惨白刺目的天光，清冷的光线平铺在抛光地砖上。消毒水的气息弥漫在空气之中，似一层稀薄无形的薄雾，萦绕在鼻尖喉间。","sourceParagraph":10829},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野站在二人中间，肩膀不受控制地微微绷紧，手指也悄悄蜷起。","sourceParagraph":10830},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这是刻在记忆深处的本能反应。儿时，只要父母语调稍稍拔高，他便会下意识留意周遭的一切：桌上的碗碟有没有摆放稳妥，房门是否关严，绞尽脑汁搜寻话题，急于把紧绷的气氛岔开。","sourceParagraph":10831},{"type":"paragraph","text":"等到步入初中，他学会了另一种应对方式：退回自己的房间，戴上耳机，静静等待外面的争吵自行落幕。","sourceParagraph":10832},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他已经很久没有这般，同时置身于父母二人之间。自打几年前离婚之后，他们几乎不会出现在同一个空间。就算逢年过节，也会默契错开时间，一个上午到访，一个下午过来，刻意避免碰面。","sourceParagraph":10833},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野原先以为，今日会是一场难熬的煎熬。","sourceParagraph":10834},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可当真的站在这里，他心底慢慢明晰——很多事，并不需要由他来出面调和斡旋。","sourceParagraph":10835},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲的话音还在继续。","sourceParagraph":10836},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「药全部拿齐了吗。」","sourceParagraph":10837},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲抬了抬手中的旅行袋，动作幅度不大，语气却带着几分倔强，像是在竭力证明自己依旧可以照料好自身。","sourceParagraph":10838},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「都收好了。」","sourceParagraph":10839},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「出院记录呢。」","sourceParagraph":10840},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「装在袋子里面。」","sourceParagraph":10841},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「复查的时间，你记在心里了？」","sourceParagraph":10842},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「单据上面写得清清楚楚。」","sourceParagraph":10843},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「纸上写着，不等于你就记住了。」","sourceParagraph":10844},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲眼皮沉沉往下一压，耐不住心底的烦躁。","sourceParagraph":10845},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你今天过来，究竟是送我出院，还是过来重新管教我。」","sourceParagraph":10846},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲脸上的神色骤然冷了下来，刚才尚且还算平和的神情，一瞬便黯淡下去。","sourceParagraph":10847},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「如果我想管教你，当初便不会走到离婚这一步。」","sourceParagraph":10848},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恰好有护士推着空轮椅从三人身侧缓缓经过，橡胶轮子碾过地面，传出一阵连绵细碎的滚动声响。","sourceParagraph":10849},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野垂落眼眸，唇角不受控制地微微抽动。","sourceParagraph":10850},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲被这一句话堵得无言以对，手里的旅行袋轻轻晃了晃，一时间竟不知该将它安放何处。","sourceParagraph":10851},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短暂数秒的沉默。","sourceParagraph":10852},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「行。」","sourceParagraph":10853},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲转头，视线恰好捕捉到程野脸上一闪而过的笑意。","sourceParagraph":10854},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你在笑什么。」","sourceParagraph":10855},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野立刻抿紧双唇，竭力压下那一点漫上来的笑意。","sourceParagraph":10856},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我没有笑。」","sourceParagraph":10857},{"type":"paragraph","text":"站在另一侧的父亲极轻地哼笑一声，眼角也泄露出一丝松动的戏谑。","sourceParagraph":10858},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「跟我一个模样。」","sourceParagraph":10859},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野抬眼看向他。","sourceParagraph":10860},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哪里像。」","sourceParagraph":10861},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲目光来回扫过父子二人的眉眼，淡淡开口。","sourceParagraph":10862},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这种时刻，倒是越发相像。」","sourceParagraph":10863},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野便不再言语。","sourceParagraph":10864},{"type":"paragraph","text":"电梯抵达，金属门缓缓向两侧滑开，轿厢内部涌来一阵带着清洁剂与金属器械混合的冰凉冷气。三个人一同迈步走入电梯。","sourceParagraph":10865},{"type":"paragraph","text":"电梯自八楼缓缓下行。","sourceParagraph":10867},{"type":"paragraph","text":"轿厢之内还站着几名病患家属。楼层数字不断往下跳动，一楼、二楼，不断有人按键出入。锃亮的金属壁面映照出几道朦胧的人影：父亲立在最靠里的角落，手上攥着那只旅行袋；母亲站在另一侧，不知何时，装药的塑料袋已经落到了她的手上。程野靠在门边。","sourceParagraph":10868},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他垂眸看向那只药袋。","sourceParagraph":10869},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「药怎么到你手上了。」","sourceParagraph":10870},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲淡淡回应。","sourceParagraph":10871},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我顺手拿一下。」","sourceParagraph":10872},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲出声反驳。","sourceParagraph":10873},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我自己拿得动。」","sourceParagraph":10874},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲没有理会，只是把药袋往手腕处又提了提，仿佛没有听见他的话语。","sourceParagraph":10875},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野保持缄默，不偏向任何一方开口辩解。","sourceParagraph":10876},{"type":"paragraph","text":"电梯抵达一楼，门向外划开。","sourceParagraph":10877},{"type":"paragraph","text":"医院大厅的光亮远比楼上更为炽盛，大片日光穿透落地玻璃窗倾泻而下，地面地砖擦拭得一尘不染，日光落上去，晃得人眼睛微微发涩。自动玻璃门反复开合，室外的滚滚热风一阵阵灌入大厅，一点点冲淡空气之中挥散不去的消毒水气味。","sourceParagraph":10878},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三人迈步走出电梯大厅。","sourceParagraph":10879},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲抬眼望向公交站台的方向，眼睛微微眯起，似乎在在心里估算步行的距离。","sourceParagraph":10880},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我坐公交回去就可以。」","sourceParagraph":10881},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲当即否决。","sourceParagraph":10882},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「打车。」","sourceParagraph":10883},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「也就几站路程。」","sourceParagraph":10884},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你昨天才刚刚办完出院。」","sourceParagraph":10885},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「出院和乘坐公交，二者之间并不冲突。」","sourceParagraph":10886},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你非要在今天，向所有人证明你身体已经完全复原吗。」","sourceParagraph":10887},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲闭紧嘴唇不再答话，指尖在旅行袋的提手上无意识轻轻叩击。","sourceParagraph":10888},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野伫立在一旁，内心没有泛起往日那种焦灼烦躁，反倒生出一丝恍如昨日的熟悉感。","sourceParagraph":10889},{"type":"paragraph","text":"从前家中灯泡损坏，母亲会坚持立刻更换，父亲却说等到明日；母亲觉得一夜黑暗都难以忍受，父亲却总觉得不必急于一时。","sourceParagraph":10890},{"type":"paragraph","text":"那时候的程野，总认定他们二人根本无法共处一室。","sourceParagraph":10891},{"type":"paragraph","text":"如今再旁观，才明白并非单纯的水火不容。只是两个人，都习惯以自己的方式，替对方做下抉择。","sourceParagraph":10892},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲已经拿出手机操作打车，拇指在屏幕上飞快滑动。","sourceParagraph":10893},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲站在一旁，面色算不上好看，却没有伸手上前阻拦。","sourceParagraph":10894},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你别叫车。」","sourceParagraph":10895},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她头也未曾抬起。","sourceParagraph":10896},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我叫我的。」","sourceParagraph":10897},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男人被这句话噎住，喉结重重滚动，最后只能将脸偏向一旁。","sourceParagraph":10898},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野心底掠过一丝浅浅的苦笑。昨日父亲才说过那句：她来是她的事。","sourceParagraph":10899},{"type":"paragraph","text":"如今换到打车这件事上，依旧是一模一样的局面。","sourceParagraph":10900},{"type":"paragraph","text":"几分钟过后，预约的车辆抵达门口。一辆白色轿车沐浴在日光之下，车身闪闪发亮。母亲快步上前，一把拉开后排的车门。","sourceParagraph":10901},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲站在原地没有挪动半步，仿佛还想要继续争辩争取。","sourceParagraph":10902},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我自己回去便足够。」","sourceParagraph":10903},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她手扶车门，神色分毫没有退让。","sourceParagraph":10904},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我并没有说，以后事事都由我来照料你。」","sourceParagraph":10905},{"type":"paragraph","text":"司机在车内静静等候。","sourceParagraph":10906},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲最终还是弯腰坐进车里，动作比平日要迟缓些许，落座的一瞬，手掌在车门边缘轻轻撑了一把借力。","sourceParagraph":10907},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野也打算跟着坐上车。","sourceParagraph":10908},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲却回过头看向他。","sourceParagraph":10909},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你准备去哪。」","sourceParagraph":10910},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「送他回家。」","sourceParagraph":10911},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你晚上不是还有约。」","sourceParagraph":10912},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野脚步骤然顿住。","sourceParagraph":10913},{"type":"paragraph","text":"已经坐进后座的父亲听闻此话，抬眼，目光从母亲脸上转移到程野身上，眼底浮出几分探究。","sourceParagraph":10914},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「什么事情。」","sourceParagraph":10915},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野的耳尖迅速泛起灼热。","sourceParagraph":10916},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没什么。」","sourceParagraph":10917},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲望着他。","sourceParagraph":10918},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「昨天你不是提起，晚上约了同学。」","sourceParagraph":10919},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲眼里的探究意味愈发浓重，刚才脸上残留的那点不快尽数散去。","sourceParagraph":10920},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野几乎能够预判他接下来的问话。","sourceParagraph":10921},{"type":"paragraph","text":"果不其然。","sourceParagraph":10922},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是沈砚？」","sourceParagraph":10923},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野的手指攥住车门边框，指节泛出青白，一时语塞，不知该如何应答。","sourceParagraph":10924},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲也顺势投来疑惑的目光。","sourceParagraph":10925},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「沈砚是谁。」","sourceParagraph":10926},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲语气平平淡淡替他解释。","sourceParagraph":10927},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「他的朋友。」","sourceParagraph":10928},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野立刻纠正。","sourceParagraph":10929},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「普通朋友而已。」","sourceParagraph":10930},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲拉长语调，轻飘飘吐出一声：「哦。」","sourceParagraph":10931},{"type":"paragraph","text":"那一声“哦”里面，明明白白裹着几分戏谑，全然不是平淡的应答。","sourceParagraph":10932},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野深深吸进一口气，抬手揉按发胀的眉心。","sourceParagraph":10933},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你们回去吧。」","sourceParagraph":10934},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲身子向后靠在车座软垫上。","sourceParagraph":10935},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不送了？」","sourceParagraph":10936},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不送。」","sourceParagraph":10937},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「刚才不是还打算跟着过来。」","sourceParagraph":10938},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「现在不想去了。」","sourceParagraph":10939},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲立在车门边，静静看了他两秒，唇角缓缓漾开一抹浅淡笑意，眼角的细纹被阳光勾勒得分明。","sourceParagraph":10940},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你去吧。」","sourceParagraph":10941},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野微微蹙眉。","sourceParagraph":10942},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「现在时间还很早。」","sourceParagraph":10943},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「早点回学校。」","sourceParagraph":10944},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她说完，顺手将那袋药放到父亲身侧的空位上，动作自然流畅，仿佛只是随手整理随身物件。","sourceParagraph":10945},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我送他。」","sourceParagraph":10946},{"type":"paragraph","text":"话音落下，父亲抬眼看向她。","sourceParagraph":10947},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲同样回望过去。","sourceParagraph":10948},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短短一秒的安静，谁也没有追问缘由。","sourceParagraph":10949},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野站在人行道上，忽然意识到，如果此刻自己也坐进后座，反倒会显得格外多余。","sourceParagraph":10950},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父亲率先挪开视线，手掌轻轻搭在膝盖。","sourceParagraph":10951},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「随便你。」","sourceParagraph":10952},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野伸手，把车门轻轻合上。","sourceParagraph":10953},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隔着一层透明车窗，母亲低头核对手机上的导航地址；父亲将那只旅行袋挪到脚边。两个人中间，空出来一整个完整的座位。","sourceParagraph":10954},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一场住院，并没有让他们骤然变回亲密无间的夫妻，也没有强行拼凑回一个完整的家。仅仅只是，他们愿意，共同走完这一段回家的车程。","sourceParagraph":10955},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这就已经足够。","sourceParagraph":10956},{"type":"paragraph","text":"轿车缓缓驶离，车尾灯两点赤红的光点，很快汇入川流不息的街道车流，慢慢消融在城市的喧嚣之中。","sourceParagraph":10957},{"type":"paragraph","text":"没过片刻，手机接连震动两声。","sourceParagraph":10958},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母亲发来：「晚上不要玩得太晚。」","sourceParagraph":10959},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紧随其后是父亲的消息：「记得把手表表带换上。」","sourceParagraph":10960},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野逐条看完，没有回复，自顾自地浅浅笑了笑。","sourceParagraph":10961},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他并没有直接返回学校。","sourceParagraph":10963},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨天买来的新表带，依旧安放在背包里面。医院附近藏着一间狭小的修表铺子，夹在药店与打印店中间，稍不留神便会擦肩而过。玻璃门上贴着几卷边角已经卷翘褪色的广告贴纸。铺子里挂满各式各样的钟表，无数秒针细碎走动的声响层层叠叠交织在一起，反倒将小屋衬得愈发静谧。","sourceParagraph":10964},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野推门走入，门上的小铃铛叮铃轻响。老师傅正埋着头修理一只电子腕表，柜台台灯暖黄的光晕笼罩住他布满花白细纹的手背。听见开门动静，他只是抬眼飞快扫过来一眼。","sourceParagraph":10965},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「修什么物件。」","sourceParagraph":10966},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野抬起左手。","sourceParagraph":10967},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「换表带。」","sourceParagraph":10968},{"type":"paragraph","text":"老师傅接过腕表，目光扫过开裂磨损的旧皮带。","sourceParagraph":10969},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这一条确实该换了。」","sourceParagraph":10970},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野的指尖下意识摩挲空空荡荡的手腕，皮肤上还残留着一道深浅分明的压痕，是旧表带长久佩戴留下的印记。","sourceParagraph":10971},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「说不定还能再多撑些时日。」","sourceParagraph":10972},{"type":"paragraph","text":"老师傅抬眸看他。","sourceParagraph":10973},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是还能撑。」","sourceParagraph":10974},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野刚打算顺势作罢，老人接续把话说完。","sourceParagraph":10975},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「只是说不定哪一刻，就会毫无预兆地直接断掉。」","sourceParagraph":10976},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野闭上嘴巴，不再争辩，把崭新的表带递过去。","sourceParagraph":10977},{"type":"paragraph","text":"老师傅拆开包装，细小的工具探进表耳缝隙，几下便把旧表带拆卸下来，随意搁置在柜台台面。","sourceParagraph":10978},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脱离表盘之后，旧表带的破败一览无余。皮革早已褪去往日光泽，边缘处处起毛磨损，平日里扣合最多的那个孔被撑得宽大变形，裂口也不止刚才父亲指出来的那一处。","sourceParagraph":10979},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野垂眸凝视，目光顺着一道道磨损痕迹慢慢游走，好似阅读一段被时光反复磨得模糊的过往。","sourceParagraph":10980},{"type":"paragraph","text":"老师傅开口询问。","sourceParagraph":10981},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「旧的这条，还要收起来吗。」","sourceParagraph":10982},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野第一反应脱口而出：「要。」","sourceParagraph":10983},{"type":"paragraph","text":"话音落下，他自己微微一顿。老师傅已经伸手准备找小收纳袋。","sourceParagraph":10984},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野伸出手指，轻轻碰了碰那一条老旧皮带。","sourceParagraph":10985},{"type":"paragraph","text":"它并不是父亲当年佩戴的原装表带。高中毕业之后，这块手表交到他手上的时候，原先的皮带就已经损坏，如今这一条，是后来另行配换的。","sourceParagraph":10986},{"type":"paragraph","text":"它并没有什么特殊的来历，仅仅只是陪伴了自己数年光阴，所以才显得陈旧。","sourceParagraph":10987},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野静静凝望片刻，指腹轻轻蹭过那道撕裂的裂口。","sourceParagraph":10988},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「算了。」","sourceParagraph":10989},{"type":"paragraph","text":"老师傅抬眼。","sourceParagraph":10990},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不要了？」","sourceParagraph":10991},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野收回自己的手。","sourceParagraph":10992},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不用留。」","sourceParagraph":10993},{"type":"paragraph","text":"老师傅随手把旧表带丢进一旁盛放废旧配件的小盒子，混杂在断裂金属表链、废弃电池之间，没有郑重的仪式，没有多余的停顿。","sourceParagraph":10994},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野往那边望了一眼，心底掠过一丝淡淡的空落，却并不生出悔意。","sourceParagraph":10995},{"type":"paragraph","text":"没过多久，新表带装配完毕。颜色和旧款十分相近，只是皮革尚且生硬挺括。老师傅把手表交还到他手中。","sourceParagraph":10996},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野戴回手腕，崭新的皮革还未曾贴合皮肤，触碰时带着一点生涩的硌感。他来回活动两下手腕，依旧不习惯这份陌生。","sourceParagraph":10997},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「戴几日，皮革便会变得柔软贴合。」老师傅淡淡说道。","sourceParagraph":10998},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野轻轻点头，付过钱款，迈步走出修表铺。","sourceParagraph":10999},{"type":"paragraph","text":"午后的日光斜斜洒落，在街道地面拉出一道道瘦长的树影。药店门口遮阳篷被风微微掀动，远处公交车驶过，裹挟起滚滚热浪与尘土。","sourceParagraph":11000},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他抬手瞥了一眼表盘，四点零七分。","sourceParagraph":11001},{"type":"paragraph","text":"依旧是那一块旧手表，唯独表带，已经换成新的了。","sourceParagraph":11002},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚五点四十下课。","sourceParagraph":11004},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人约在校外一间平平无奇的家常小饭馆，既不是医院周边，也不是心理中心附近，更不是从前一同到访过的餐馆，是程野特意挑选的地点。","sourceParagraph":11005},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚抵达的时候，他已经在座位上坐了十分钟。桌面上仅仅摆着一壶沏好的茶水。程野手里捏着菜单，目光反复停留在同一页，指尖压着菜单边缘，好几次想要翻动，又停下，仿佛只要一直阅读菜单，就能够暂缓直面心底那些难以言说的心绪。","sourceParagraph":11006},{"type":"paragraph","text":"门口风铃叮咚一声轻响。","sourceParagraph":11007},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野抬眼望去。","sourceParagraph":11008},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚今日没有穿惯常利落的衬衫，身上是一件薄款灰蓝色针织上衣，袖口妥帖收拢在腕部，长发简单低扎在脑后。踏入店门，她目光淡淡扫过店内，很快便捕捉到程野的位置。","sourceParagraph":11009},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暖黄的店内灯光落在她肩头，勾勒出一圈柔和的轮廓。","sourceParagraph":11010},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野身体下意识坐直几分，刚才松垮倚靠椅背的姿态尽数收敛。","sourceParagraph":11011},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚走到桌前，拉开椅子落座。","sourceParagraph":11012},{"type":"paragraph","text":"开口第一句，语气平淡自然。","sourceParagraph":11013},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「叔叔顺利到家了？」","sourceParagraph":11014},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":11015},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「过程还算顺遂？」","sourceParagraph":11016},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「勉强算得上顺利。」","sourceParagraph":11017},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「阿姨呢。」","sourceParagraph":11018},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是她坐车送回去的。」","sourceParagraph":11019},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚的眉梢极轻微向上扬起。","sourceParagraph":11020},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哦。」","sourceParagraph":11021},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野望向她。","sourceParagraph":11022},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你这个“哦”，是什么意思。」","sourceParagraph":11023},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没有别的意思。」","sourceParagraph":11024},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我不信。」","sourceParagraph":11025},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚伸手，指尖轻轻敲了敲纸质菜单。","sourceParagraph":11026},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今天是你主动约我吃饭，怎么反倒一直在聊他们的事情。」","sourceParagraph":11027},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野话语卡在喉咙，一时语塞。他低下头，提起茶壶往杯中注水，热水撞进玻璃杯，漾开浅浅热气，灯光在晃动的水面揉成一片细碎的金色光斑。","sourceParagraph":11028},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就不谈这些。」","sourceParagraph":11029},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚翻开菜单。","sourceParagraph":11030},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「想好点什么菜了吗。」","sourceParagraph":11031},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「等你过来再选。」","sourceParagraph":11032},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「为什么。」","sourceParagraph":11033},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野差点脱口而出那句玩笑——怕你什么都不肯吃。话到舌尖，又硬生生咽了回去。","sourceParagraph":11034},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不清楚你想吃什么。」","sourceParagraph":11035},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚把菜单推到桌子正中，两个人一同看向菜品列表。","sourceParagraph":11036},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野指尖点向一道家常菜。","sourceParagraph":11037},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这个怎么样。」","sourceParagraph":11038},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「可以。」","sourceParagraph":11039},{"type":"paragraph","text":"又指向另一道。","sourceParagraph":11040},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这道呢。」","sourceParagraph":11041},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「也行。」","sourceParagraph":11042},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么你全都“也行”。」","sourceParagraph":11043},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚抬眼看向他。","sourceParagraph":11044},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野自己先意识到，无奈地摇摇头。","sourceParagraph":11045},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「算了。」","sourceParagraph":11046},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚唇角浅浅牵动。","sourceParagraph":11047},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最终敲定三道菜，分量刚刚好。服务员取走菜单之后，饭桌之间漫开一阵安静。","sourceParagraph":11048},{"type":"paragraph","text":"饭馆并不算冷清，邻桌几名学生正讨论考试课业；厨房的门不停开合，锅铲碰撞铁锅的脆响一阵阵传来。窗外暮色慢慢沉降，初夏傍晚的柔光透过玻璃窗照进来，杯壁被光线映照得通透。门缝钻进晚风，混杂街边树叶清香与淡淡油烟气息。","sourceParagraph":11049},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野端起杯子抿了一口茶水。","sourceParagraph":11050},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚的视线落向他的手腕。","sourceParagraph":11051},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「表带换好了。」","sourceParagraph":11052},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野垂眸看向手腕。","sourceParagraph":11053},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":11054},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「什么时候换的。」","sourceParagraph":11055},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「下午，从医院出来之后。」","sourceParagraph":11056},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚伸出手，却没有直接握住他的手腕，只是指尖轻轻触碰新表带靠近表扣的位置，皮革生涩的质感从指尖传递过去。","sourceParagraph":11057},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「摸起来很硬。」","sourceParagraph":11058},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「修表师傅说戴几天就会变软。」","sourceParagraph":11059},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「旧的那条呢。」","sourceParagraph":11060},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野沉默两秒，眼底掠过一丝复杂的情绪。","sourceParagraph":11061},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「丢掉了。」","sourceParagraph":11062},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚抬眼看向他。","sourceParagraph":11063},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「舍得？」","sourceParagraph":11064},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那一条并不是父亲原先的原装表带。」","sourceParagraph":11065},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「原来是这样。」","sourceParagraph":11066},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野望着她。","sourceParagraph":11067},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就只有这样？」","sourceParagraph":11068},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不然还该如何。」沈砚收回自己的手，语气淡然，「旧了，便可以换掉。」","sourceParagraph":11069},{"type":"paragraph","text":"简简单单一句话。","sourceParagraph":11070},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野低头凝视手腕上的表盘，表盘本体依旧是陪伴许久的旧物件，边框上面细小的划痕完好留存，秒针依旧沉稳规律地向前跳动。他不由得浅浅一笑。","sourceParagraph":11071},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「若是放在从前，我说不定会把旧的好好收起来。」","sourceParagraph":11072},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「现在不愿意留了？」","sourceParagraph":11073},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":11074},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「缘由是什么。」","sourceParagraph":11075},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野稍稍思索，摇了摇头。","sourceParagraph":11076},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「也说不清该放在什么地方。」","sourceParagraph":11077},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚静静看着他。","sourceParagraph":11078},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野忍不住笑出声。","sourceParagraph":11079},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「真的，宿舍储物柜已经堆得满满当当。」","sourceParagraph":11080},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这一回，沈砚的唇边也漾开淡淡的笑意。","sourceParagraph":11081},{"type":"paragraph","text":"菜肴陆续端上桌，二人安静进食。不再提起医院、检查报告，不再谈及害怕或是纠结。","sourceParagraph":11083},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吃到中途，程野忽然开口。","sourceParagraph":11084},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「上午课堂上讲访谈技术，老师在投影上面写下那句——允许对话里出现沉默。」","sourceParagraph":11085},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚夹菜的动作顿住，筷尖悬停在餐盘上空。","sourceParagraph":11086},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么突然说起这个。」","sourceParagraph":11087},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我那一瞬间差点笑出来。」","sourceParagraph":11088},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「为什么。」","sourceParagraph":11089},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「感觉身边的人，接二连三都在教我这一课。」","sourceParagraph":11090},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「都有谁。」","sourceParagraph":11091},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「幕，你，就连我父亲，多多少少也算。」","sourceParagraph":11092},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚低头舀起一勺汤，升腾起的薄薄水汽，朦胧了眼底一闪而过的笑意。","sourceParagraph":11093},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「学到几分了。」","sourceParagraph":11094},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一点点。」","sourceParagraph":11095},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「举个例子听听。」","sourceParagraph":11096},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野思索片刻。","sourceParagraph":11097},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「现在你沉默不说话的时候，我不会急着慌忙找话填补空隙。」","sourceParagraph":11098},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚抬眸望向他。","sourceParagraph":11099},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人对视数秒。","sourceParagraph":11100},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野紧跟着补充，语气带着一点自我调侃。","sourceParagraph":11101},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「当然，也不能一直彻底闭口不言。」","sourceParagraph":11102},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚淡淡回应。","sourceParagraph":11103},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这么看，还是没有完全学通透。」","sourceParagraph":11104},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野低低笑起来。","sourceParagraph":11105},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「慢慢来。」","sourceParagraph":11106},{"type":"paragraph","text":"话音落下，他自己也微微一怔。这句话往日很少会从自己口中说出口。","sourceParagraph":11107},{"type":"paragraph","text":"过去的他，总盼着所有事情尽快落地，尽快结束，尽快拿到确定的结果。对待人与人之间的关系亦是如此：如果预判结局会走向别离，便索性不要过度靠近；如果预感事态终将变坏，便提前备好最坏的心理预案。","sourceParagraph":11108},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可经历了这许多之后才慢慢懂得，很多人和事，会悬停在中途。没有标准答案，日子也依旧要继续过下去。","sourceParagraph":11109},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野拿起筷子，夹起一块嫩豆腐，筷尖轻轻磕碰瓷碗边缘，发出一声细微轻响。","sourceParagraph":11110},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「昨天，你为什么愿意过来医院。」","sourceParagraph":11111},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他忽然发问。","sourceParagraph":11112},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚没有立刻作答，缓缓把筷子搁在餐盘边沿，指尖安静地平放在桌面。","sourceParagraph":11113},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「因为是你开口邀约我的。」","sourceParagraph":11114},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「仅仅只是这个理由？」","sourceParagraph":11115},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":11116},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「如果我没有开口提呢。」","sourceParagraph":11117},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那我大概率不会主动前往。」","sourceParagraph":11118},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野的身体微微一顿，这个回答比他心里预想的更加直白。","sourceParagraph":11119},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚望向他，神色平静无波。","sourceParagraph":11120},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么。」","sourceParagraph":11121},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「有一点点出乎意料。」","sourceParagraph":11122},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「为什么会觉得意外。」","sourceParagraph":11123},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我原先以为，就算我不说，你也会主动过来。」","sourceParagraph":11124},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚轻轻摇了摇头。","sourceParagraph":11125},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你不是向来反感旁人擅自替你做决定。」","sourceParagraph":11126},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野抬眼看向她。","sourceParagraph":11127},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我想去，和我应你的邀约前去，这是两件互不相同的事。」沈砚缓缓解释，「昨天是你父亲住院，并不是属于我的事情。」","sourceParagraph":11128},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野安静聆听，手里的筷子慢慢静止。","sourceParagraph":11129},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚接续往下说。","sourceParagraph":11130},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你希望我在场，我便赴约。你不开口，我便不会自行揣测你的心意。」","sourceParagraph":11131},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野陷入短暂沉默，喉咙像是被什么东西轻轻擦过，泛起一阵微涩。","sourceParagraph":11132},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你内心，是想要过来的吗。」","sourceParagraph":11133},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这一次轮到沈砚沉默。","sourceParagraph":11134},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野没有急于催促，安安静静等候，不再习惯性抢先收回问句。","sourceParagraph":11135},{"type":"paragraph","text":"饭馆周遭喧嚣依旧：邻桌挪动椅子，椅脚摩擦地面；后厨传来报菜的呼喊；街边公交到站，车门开合，行人熙攘。唯独他们这一方小桌，笼罩在一片温和的寂静之中。","sourceParagraph":11136},{"type":"paragraph","text":"过了片刻，沈砚轻轻吐出一个字。","sourceParagraph":11137},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「想。」","sourceParagraph":11138},{"type":"paragraph","text":"简简单单一字落进耳朵。","sourceParagraph":11139},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野眼底神色微微一动，仿佛一根紧绷许久的心弦，稍稍松缓下来，却又不敢全然松懈。","sourceParagraph":11140},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那为什么不主动过来。」","sourceParagraph":11141},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚重新拿起筷子，指尖捏得略紧，指节透出淡淡的薄白。","sourceParagraph":11142},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我会害怕，害怕那并不是你内心真正想要的。」","sourceParagraph":11143},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野怔怔地看着她。","sourceParagraph":11144},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这是他很少会从沈砚口中听见的一个词。不是惧怕病痛，不是惧怕繁重课业，而是害怕自己的奔赴，并不是对方内心所期盼的。","sourceParagraph":11145},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚垂眸，神情看不出太大起伏。","sourceParagraph":11146},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野轻声开口。","sourceParagraph":11147},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「以后，你可以直接问我。」","sourceParagraph":11148},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚抬眼看向他。","sourceParagraph":11149},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「问什么。」","sourceParagraph":11150},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「直接问我，我是否希望你过来。」程野认真说道，「不必自己在心底反复猜测。」","sourceParagraph":11151},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚凝视他几秒，唇角浮起一点浅淡弧度。","sourceParagraph":11152},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你也是一样。」","sourceParagraph":11153},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野嘴角扬起来。","sourceParagraph":11154},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「好。」","sourceParagraph":11155},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晚饭吃到一半，程野的手机铃声骤然响起。","sourceParagraph":11157},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屏幕来电人显示是父亲。","sourceParagraph":11158},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野接起。听筒音量不小，就连坐在对面的沈砚，也能够隐约捕捉到电话那头传来的说话声。","sourceParagraph":11159},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野脸上的神情从平静，一点点过渡到无奈，眉头微微蹙起，片刻之后，只能抬手捏了捏发胀的眉心。","sourceParagraph":11160},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「药吃过了？」","sourceParagraph":11161},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短暂停顿。","sourceParagraph":11162},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你打给我，究竟是为了什么。」","sourceParagraph":11163},{"type":"paragraph","text":"电话那头传来话语。","sourceParagraph":11164},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野低头看了一眼手机上的时间。","sourceParagraph":11165},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「七点零九分，你的手机上面看不到时间吗。」","sourceParagraph":11166},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚微微低下头，肩膀极轻地颤动，明显在隐忍笑意。","sourceParagraph":11167},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野捕捉到这一幕，投过去一道略带警告的目光。","sourceParagraph":11168},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚拿起水杯挡在脸前，眼底的笑意却藏不住。","sourceParagraph":11169},{"type":"paragraph","text":"听筒里面又传来几句叮嘱。","sourceParagraph":11170},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野眉头皱得更深。","sourceParagraph":11171},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我正在外面吃饭。」","sourceParagraph":11172},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「和同学在一起。」","sourceParagraph":11173},{"type":"paragraph","text":"又隔数秒。","sourceParagraph":11174},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这些事情你不必问。」","sourceParagraph":11175},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚再也压不住，肩头轻轻抖动。","sourceParagraph":11176},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野的耳尖迅速发烫。","sourceParagraph":11177},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我先挂了。」","sourceParagraph":11178},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通话挂断，手机被倒扣搁在桌面上。","sourceParagraph":11179},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚抬眸看过来。","sourceParagraph":11180},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「叔叔刚才在问，跟你吃饭的是谁？」","sourceParagraph":11181},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「听见了还故意问。」","sourceParagraph":11182},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「只是确认一下。」","sourceParagraph":11183},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野端起水杯，大口喝了一口，耳根依旧泛着热度。","sourceParagraph":11184},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你们现在，都很喜欢打趣我。」","sourceParagraph":11185},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚浅浅弯起嘴角。","sourceParagraph":11186},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晚饭结束，外面夜色已经彻底铺展开。","sourceParagraph":11188},{"type":"paragraph","text":"五月末的夜晚裹挟着薄薄一层湿润的潮气，街边行道树枝繁叶茂，路灯的光亮被层层叶片切割成细碎晃动的光斑。烧烤店排风扇呼呼转动，油烟混着辣椒香气四处飘散。远处高架桥上车流不息，车辆驶过的轰鸣一阵阵遥遥传来，如同潮水远远起落。","sourceParagraph":11189},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人并肩朝着学校方向步行，并不急着赶回宿舍。","sourceParagraph":11190},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一路上沈砚的脚步，总是会比程野快出小半步。走过一处十字路口，程野留意到这个细节。","sourceParagraph":11191},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你怎么走得这么急。」","sourceParagraph":11192},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚放慢步伐。","sourceParagraph":11193},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「习惯而已。」","sourceParagraph":11194},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「又没有什么要紧事要赶。」","sourceParagraph":11195},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「行。」","sourceParagraph":11196},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脚步放缓之后，两个人真正并排而行。","sourceParagraph":11197},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走到一段行人稀少的街道，程野忽然开口唤她名字。","sourceParagraph":11198},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「沈砚。」","sourceParagraph":11199},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":11200},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今天这一顿晚饭。」","sourceParagraph":11201},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他把手插进外套口袋，刚刚更换表带的左手自然垂落在身侧。短暂停顿，他才继续把心底的话说出来。","sourceParagraph":11202},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「并不是因为前几日你陪我去医院。」","sourceParagraph":11203},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚偏过头望向他。","sourceParagraph":11204},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野目光落在前方路灯，灯火穿过树叶缝隙，在路面投下一片片摇曳的碎光。","sourceParagraph":11205},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我并不是出于亏欠，才约你吃饭。」","sourceParagraph":11206},{"type":"paragraph","text":"话说出口，他又微微皱眉，发觉自己这样的表述依旧不够贴切。","sourceParagraph":11207},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚安静地听着，没有打断他。","sourceParagraph":11208},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野继续往前走，语气很真诚。","sourceParagraph":11209},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「也不是单纯想要谢谢你。昨天开口约你的时候，就只是……」","sourceParagraph":11210},{"type":"paragraph","text":"话语短暂卡顿。路边树上有飞鸟振翅而起，翅膀拍打树叶，传出一阵簌簌轻响。","sourceParagraph":11211},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野垂眸看向脚下，鞋底碾过地面干枯的落叶，碎裂的叶片发出细碎声响。","sourceParagraph":11212},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就是单纯想要和你一起吃顿饭。仅此而已。」","sourceParagraph":11213},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚安静片刻，轻声应答。","sourceParagraph":11214},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我明白。」","sourceParagraph":11215},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野转过头看向她，眼里带着一点诧异。","sourceParagraph":11216},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你早就明白？」","sourceParagraph":11217},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「昨天你发出邀约的时候，我便懂。」","sourceParagraph":11218},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野心底掠过一丝淡淡的挫败，可唇角还是不受控制向上扬起。","sourceParagraph":11219},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那我还絮絮叨叨解释这么半天。」","sourceParagraph":11220},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是你自己想要解释清楚。」","sourceParagraph":11221},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野一时语塞，随即低低地笑出声来。","sourceParagraph":11222},{"type":"paragraph","text":"临近校园门口，街边立着一间奶茶小店，门头悬挂一串串暖黄色装饰小灯，玻璃门内人影往来，吸管与杯盖碰撞的细碎声响隔着门板隐约可闻。","sourceParagraph":11224},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚停下脚步。","sourceParagraph":11225},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「要不要喝点什么。」","sourceParagraph":11226},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野扫了一眼店铺。","sourceParagraph":11227},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你想喝？」","sourceParagraph":11228},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":11229},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就进去买。」","sourceParagraph":11230},{"type":"paragraph","text":"说完，程野便迈步朝店门走去。","sourceParagraph":11231},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚站在原地没有立刻跟上。","sourceParagraph":11232},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野回头。","sourceParagraph":11233},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么不走。」","sourceParagraph":11234},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你不问我想要点什么？」","sourceParagraph":11235},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你自己进店点就可以。」","sourceParagraph":11236},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚眼底掠过一抹浅浅笑意，跟了上来。","sourceParagraph":11237},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柜台之前，沈砚点了一杯常规少糖奶茶。程野本来并无饮用的念头，浏览一遍菜单之后，最后选了一杯柠檬水。","sourceParagraph":11238},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店员出声询问。","sourceParagraph":11239},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「两位是一并结算吗。」","sourceParagraph":11240},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野和沈砚同时对视。","sourceParagraph":11241},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野刚要开口，沈砚已经拿出手机。","sourceParagraph":11242},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「各付各的。」","sourceParagraph":11243},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店员点点头。","sourceParagraph":11244},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野看向她。","sourceParagraph":11245},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一杯奶茶而已，我请客也无妨。」","sourceParagraph":11246},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我想要自己付。」","sourceParagraph":11247},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野稍稍沉默。","sourceParagraph":11248},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「好吧。」","sourceParagraph":11249},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不再继续争执。","sourceParagraph":11250},{"type":"paragraph","text":"各自完成付款，站在店门外等候取餐。晚风从街口吹拂过来，吹散鬓边几缕碎发，沈砚抬手，把散乱的发丝轻轻别回耳后，指尖在耳廓边上短暂停留。","sourceParagraph":11251},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野的视线不经意扫过，很快移开。","sourceParagraph":11252},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店员报出取餐号。","sourceParagraph":11253},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚上前拿自己的饮品，顺手也一并把程野的柠檬水带了出来，递到他手上。","sourceParagraph":11254},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「给你。」","sourceParagraph":11255},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野接过纸杯。","sourceParagraph":11256},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「多谢。」","sourceParagraph":11257},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚淡淡回道：「不用。」","sourceParagraph":11258},{"type":"paragraph","text":"话音落下，两个人同时微微一顿。","sourceParagraph":11259},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚先露出一点笑意。","sourceParagraph":11260},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野低头看着手里的杯子，也不由得笑了。","sourceParagraph":11261},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这一句不用，是真心实意的。」","sourceParagraph":11262},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我知晓。」","sourceParagraph":11263},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人继续朝着校内走去。","sourceParagraph":11264},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踏入校门，围墙隔绝掉街道的喧嚣，只剩下远处模糊的车流嗡鸣。晚风穿梭在繁茂的树冠之间，树叶互相摩挲，沙沙作响，好似黑暗之中低声絮语。路边长椅上坐着三三两两的学生，有人闲谈，有人就只是并肩静坐。","sourceParagraph":11265},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野含住吸管，抿了一大口柠檬水，浓烈的酸意漫开，他眉头轻轻蹙起。","sourceParagraph":11266},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚瞥见他的神情。","sourceParagraph":11267},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「很难喝？」","sourceParagraph":11268},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还算可以。」","sourceParagraph":11269},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚目光落在他脸上。","sourceParagraph":11270},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野老老实实改口。","sourceParagraph":11271},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「很酸。」","sourceParagraph":11272},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚把手里的奶茶往他的方向递过去少许。","sourceParagraph":11273},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「要不要尝一口。」","sourceParagraph":11274},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野下意识打算回绝，话到嘴边顿住。短暂迟疑之后，微微低头，凑过去吸了一口吸管。","sourceParagraph":11275},{"type":"paragraph","text":"等反应过来吸管是刚才沈砚用过的，已经来不及。","sourceParagraph":11276},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野的身体瞬间僵住，奶茶清甜的滋味在舌尖化开。","sourceParagraph":11277},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚握着纸杯的手，也有片刻僵硬。","sourceParagraph":11278},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两个人距离挨得很近，路灯穿过枝叶缝隙，一半光亮落在沈砚的半边脸颊，程野的耳尖迅速染上一层灼热的绯红。","sourceParagraph":11279},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一时间谁都没有动弹。","sourceParagraph":11280},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最终还是程野以后退开半步，喉结轻轻滚动，把口中饮品咽下去。","sourceParagraph":11281},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「挺甜的。」","sourceParagraph":11282},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚把杯子收回到身前，视线刻意避开他的脸庞。","sourceParagraph":11283},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是少糖款。」","sourceParagraph":11284},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就算少糖，对比我的柠檬水依旧很甜。」","sourceParagraph":11285},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚：「你的那杯本身就是酸的。」","sourceParagraph":11286},{"type":"paragraph","text":"简单的对话，听上去平平常常，内里却藏着一丝难以言说的局促。","sourceParagraph":11287},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人并肩继续向前行走，将近一分钟，没有人再多言语。","sourceParagraph":11288},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野忽然低低笑了一声。","sourceParagraph":11289},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚侧过头。","sourceParagraph":11290},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「笑什么。」","sourceParagraph":11291},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没什么。」","sourceParagraph":11292},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚微微眯起眼睛。","sourceParagraph":11293},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野依旧不肯解释，只是笑意止不住浮现在眉眼，沈砚的耳尖，也悄悄泛开淡淡的红色。","sourceParagraph":11294},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走到宿舍区岔路口，脚步自然而然停下。沈砚与程野的宿舍楼分属两个不同方向。","sourceParagraph":11296},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若是换作往日，到此处，大多就一句简单的「走了」就此道别。但今夜，两个人谁都没有率先开口。","sourceParagraph":11297},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野低头看了看手里的柠檬水，已经喝掉大半。沈砚手中的奶茶，尚且剩余许多。","sourceParagraph":11298},{"type":"paragraph","text":"远处宿舍楼一排排窗户灯火通明，阳台上传来零星的生活声响。沉沉夜色将楼宇的轮廓柔化，一盏盏窗户，仿佛散落在黑暗里一方方小小的光亮窗口。","sourceParagraph":11299},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚率先打破这份安静。","sourceParagraph":11300},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明天叔叔需要回院复查吗。」","sourceParagraph":11301},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不需要。」","sourceParagraph":11302},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你呢。」","sourceParagraph":11303},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「照常上课。」","sourceParagraph":11304},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哦。」","sourceParagraph":11305},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野抬眼看向她。","sourceParagraph":11306},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你。」","sourceParagraph":11307},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我也是，有课。」","sourceParagraph":11308},{"type":"paragraph","text":"谈话又一次短暂搁浅。","sourceParagraph":11309},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野站在原地，觉得这般杵在路口有几分滑稽可笑，可心底又并不想就此匆匆告别。手指无意识触碰手腕上新换的表带，皮革依旧生硬，蹭在皮肤上，带来一阵陌生的触感。","sourceParagraph":11310},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚留意到他这个小动作。","sourceParagraph":11311},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「依旧不习惯？」","sourceParagraph":11312},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「有一点点。」","sourceParagraph":11313},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「过上几天便会适应。」","sourceParagraph":11314},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":11315},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野松开触碰表带的指尖，忽然开口。","sourceParagraph":11316},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「下次吃饭。」","sourceParagraph":11317},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚望向他。","sourceParagraph":11318},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这一回，程野没有说出「看你时间」这类给自己留退路的话语，也没有模棱两可的假设。","sourceParagraph":11319},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「地方你来挑选。」","sourceParagraph":11320},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚眼底缓缓漾开浅浅笑意。","sourceParagraph":11321},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「为何是我选。」","sourceParagraph":11322},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今天是我选的饭馆。」","sourceParagraph":11323},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「所以就要轮流吗。」","sourceParagraph":11324},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野稍稍思索，轻轻摇头。","sourceParagraph":11325},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不是轮流。」","sourceParagraph":11326},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你想吃什么，就选什么地方就好。」","sourceParagraph":11327},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚凝视他。","sourceParagraph":11328},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「若是我选的，你并不爱吃呢。」","sourceParagraph":11329},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那我会直接跟你讲。」","sourceParagraph":11330},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚浅浅笑起来。","sourceParagraph":11331},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我还以为，你会继续说“都行”。」","sourceParagraph":11332},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野也笑。","sourceParagraph":11333},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「最近不太想再说“都行”。」","sourceParagraph":11334},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚轻轻点头。","sourceParagraph":11335},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「好。」","sourceParagraph":11336},{"type":"paragraph","text":"终于有了可以就此分开的由头。","sourceParagraph":11337},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚转过身，迈步离开。","sourceParagraph":11338},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走出几步远，程野忽然出声唤住她。","sourceParagraph":11339},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「沈砚。」","sourceParagraph":11340},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她停下脚步回过头，路灯穿过枝叶，一缕光亮落在她的肩头。","sourceParagraph":11341},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野刚才开口的时候，自己都并不明确想要说些什么。两个人隔着数米的距离对望。","sourceParagraph":11342},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最后，他只是抬手，晃了晃手里的柠檬水纸杯。","sourceParagraph":11343},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「这个，实在太酸了。」","sourceParagraph":11344},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚伫立原地两秒，忍不住笑出声。","sourceParagraph":11345},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你还一直喝。」","sourceParagraph":11346},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野被问得一噎，随即自己也笑。","sourceParagraph":11347},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「买都已经买好了。」","sourceParagraph":11348},{"type":"paragraph","text":"话音落下，他自己都察觉到这句话的别扭。","sourceParagraph":11349},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野目光落向脚边的垃圾桶，上前两步，把还剩下小半杯的柠檬水丢了进去，塑料纸杯落进桶底，发出闷闷的轻响。","sourceParagraph":11350},{"type":"paragraph","text":"做完这些，才重新看向沈砚。","sourceParagraph":11351},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「现在不喝了。」","sourceParagraph":11352},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚唇角依旧带着笑意。","sourceParagraph":11353},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":11354},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「走了。」","sourceParagraph":11355},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明天见。」","sourceParagraph":11356},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野本已经转过身，听见这四个字，脚步顿住，再次回过头。","sourceParagraph":11357},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明天见。」","sourceParagraph":11358},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这一次，没有「到时候再说」，也没有「有事就算了」这类预先给自己留好退路的话。就只是简简单单，定下一个寻常的明天。","sourceParagraph":11359},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野朝着自己宿舍楼的方向走去。","sourceParagraph":11360},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手腕上新的表带时不时摩擦皮肤，那份生涩的触感依旧真切。旧的表带已经遗弃在修表铺。医院的风波暂时告一段落。父母之间的纠葛，交由他们二人自行去面对处理。","sourceParagraph":11361},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明天还有课程，还有一顿已经说好的饭，还有一个约好了要再见的人。","sourceParagraph":11362},{"type":"image","assetId":"image37","sourceParagraph":11364}],"textChars":10601,"hanChars":8996,"imageCount":1}